<ProLegalDocument
  title="Terms of Service"
  eyebrow="The Pro workspace agreement"
  description="Terms governing the ImageToURL Pro paid image-hosting subscription."
  intro="These terms govern your account, uploaded content, plan limits, recurring subscription, and use of ImageToURL Pro."
>
  <section>
    <h2>1. Operator and acceptance</h2>
    <p>
      ImageToURL Pro is operated by <strong>Bipul Kumar</strong> in India. By creating a workspace or
      subscribing, you agree to these Terms, the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>,
      <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>, and
      <a href="/acceptable-use-policy">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>2. What Pro includes</h2>
    <p>
      The founding plan provides one Pro workspace with 50GB active storage, files up to 50MB, up to
      1 million image views per month, permanent HTTPS URLs, original-quality storage, public and private
      assets, folders, URL import, and usage information.
    </p>
    <p>
      Production API access is included when released but is currently a private beta and is not a
      production-ready deliverable at purchase.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
