      royalty-free license to store, reproduce, cache, transmit, and technically process it only as needed
      to operate, secure, and improve the service or follow your instructions.
    </p>
    <p>You confirm that you have all rights needed to upload, store, and distribute the content.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>5. Price, renewal, and Paddle</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Monthly Pro is USD $4.99 per month.</li>
      <li>Annual Pro is USD $39 per year.</li>
      <li>Applicable tax or VAT is calculated at checkout.</li>
      <li>The subscription renews automatically for the chosen interval until canceled before renewal.</li>
      <li>The founding price remains locked only while the original subscription stays continuously active.</li>
      <li>Each optional 50GB storage pack is USD $2.99 monthly or USD $24 annually.</li>
