      transaction taxes, receipts, invoices, and buyer payment support. Paddle’s buyer terms apply to the
      transaction.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>6. Storage add-ons</h2>
    <p>
      A Pro workspace may hold up to ten recurring 50GB storage packs. Add-ons must share the base
      subscription’s monthly or annual billing interval. Before applying a mid-cycle change, the workspace
      shows Paddle’s preview of any immediate charge and the next renewal total.
    </p>
    <p>
      Reducing or removing packs lowers the allowance after Paddle accepts the change. If current usage is
      above the new allowance, existing files remain available but new uploads may pause until usage is
      reduced or capacity is restored.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>7. Cancellation and refunds</h2>
    <p>
      Cancel through the Paddle portal available in workspace settings. Cancellation stops future renewal
      and normally leaves access active through the paid period. Refunds follow our
      <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> and non-waivable consumer law.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
