      prohibited by law.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>12. Changes, disputes, and contact</h2>
    <p>
      Material changes will be posted here and communicated where appropriate. Contact
      <a href="mailto:blog.boopul@gmail.com">blog.boopul@gmail.com</a> before starting a formal dispute so
      we can try to resolve it. Applicable law governs without limiting mandatory consumer rights in your
      country of residence.
    </p>
  </section>
